{"title":"State Bikes and Liquid Death Team Up for a Special $666 Halloween Trick-or-Treat Drop","link":"https://bikerumor.com/state-bikes-and-liquid-death-team-up-for-a-special-666-halloween-trick-or-treat-drop/","date":1793375875000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-hero.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"(Photos / State Bike Co.)\" /></p>\n<p>State Bikes has joined forces with Liquid Death on a limited-edition collection built around two of the brand’s sparkling water cans. It includes bespoke colorways, apparel, and à la carte components for adding a little death to your ride.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab first pic\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-first-pic-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / State Bike Co.)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Let’s just jump right in. </p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Here’s the Trick…</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab gold bike\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-bike-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The centerpiece of the release is the 6061 Black Label v3 Aluminum Single Speed. It comes in two colorways: Classic Black and Gold that matches the original Liquid Death Mountain Water…</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab gold frame\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-gold-frame-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab pink\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-pink-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And Vibrant Pink/Black that pairs with Scary Strawberry Sparkling Energy. Both are available as framesets or complete builds. It’s your call.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>And, Here’s the Treat…</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>All of this happens on Halloween only, so make sure you get to the State Bicycle Co. site tomorrow (tonight at midnight). Starting 10/31 at 12:01 am PST, State is running a $666 “Trick or Treat” sale on the complete bike. You pick your size only and buy sight unseen. That sounds like you won’t know what color or spec you’ll end up with, but State promises you won’t be disappointed.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab saddle\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This is for one day only, then it’s gone. To help with your decision-making… regular pricing is $899.99 for the complete bike and $549.99 for the frameset, so the Halloween price is a real discount on the complete build.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab drivetrain\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-drivetrain-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>State X Liquid Death Black Label Details</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Frame:</strong> 6061 Black Label v3 aluminum</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Drivetrain:</strong> Single speed</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Colorways:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic Black and Gold (matches Liquid Death Mountain Water)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pink/Black (pairs with Scary Strawberry Sparkling Energy)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Availability:</strong> Framesets or complete builds</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Halloween-only price:</strong> $666 complete, size selection only, sold sight unseen</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Regular MSRP:</strong> $899.99 complete, $549.99 frameset</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Extras:</strong> Stem cap, saddle, jersey, and cap, plus à la carte components</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2>The Rest of the Collection</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The collection also includes a stem cap, saddle, jersey, and cap, so you can match your kit to your can.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Stem Cap</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $9.99</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144.jpeg\"><img width=\"840\" height=\"546\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab stem cap\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144.jpeg 840w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144-297x193.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144-120x78.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-stem-cap-e1793306201144-768x499.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>Saddle</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $35</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab saddle left\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-left-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab saddle right\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-saddle-right-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>Jersey</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $69.99</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"859\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab jersey left\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left-297x199.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left-120x81.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-left-768x515.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"859\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab jersey right\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right-297x199.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right-120x81.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-jersey-right-768x515.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h3>Cap</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $24.95</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"859\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab cap left\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left-297x199.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left-120x81.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-left-768x515.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"859\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right.jpeg\" alt=\"State X Liquid Death Collab cap right\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right-297x199.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right-120x81.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/State-X-Liquid-Death-Collab-cap-right-768x515.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’ve been eyeing a simple, affordable single speed, this one has the paint job and the price to make the wait worthwhile. Just don’t sleep on it, because it’s here for one day.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>The Link:</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.statebicycle.com/collections/state-bicycle-co-x-liquid-death\">https://www.statebicycle.com/collections/state-bicycle-co-x-liquid-death</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Reminder: this link is password-protected and won’t be live until tonight at 12:01 am PST. </p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/state-bikes-and-liquid-death-team-up-for-a-special-666-halloween-trick-or-treat-drop/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"83ceea3b27f7cbbef8b75dab1e956f5b35461dab48674660eeb673b4ee318104","category":"Cycling"}